title: 'Install audit: atelier doctor, full crew, CLI path, pnpm guard'
summary: 'Triage of a friend''s fresh clone where Sonnet didn''t know what `atelier design` was. Root causes: the skills only exist after `atelier setup` (never run in a clone), npm 0.38.0 predates setup, `npm install` breaks the pnpm workspace, setup didn''t install Mika/Lux/Quill/Iris, skills referenced repo-only files, and `atelier` isn''t on PATH from a source build. Fixed all of it and verified end to end on a fresh clone with an empty HOME and PATH.'
